DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The wwbbssdd driver provides support for the SD memory card interface of the
     Winbond W83L518D/W83L519D integrated media reader.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     whatever MMC, SD, SDHC, or SDIO devices are inserted into the SD slot.

